-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- 3. metamorphic / condition-indexed folds
-- a metamorphic fold (e.g. a voltage- and ligand-gated ion channel or gap junction) is a
-- FoldProblem on one configuration carrier C, parameterized by environmental condition E
MetaFold : (E C : Type 0) → Type 1
MetaFold E C = E → FoldProblem C
